{% card "Playing & Listening", "prose" %}
  <p>
    I have an oddly diverse range of musical taste. I’m a huge fan of progressive and heavy
    metal—favorites include Dream Theater, Pain of Salvation, Ayreon, Judas Priest, and Savatage.
    I also listen to modern jazz (e.g., E.S.T.), classic ballads (Julie London, Barbra Streisand,
    Ella Fitzgerald), and classical music (Vivaldi, Tchaikovsky). You’ll also catch Turkish artists
    like Barış Manço, Birsen Tezer, and Jehan Barbur in my playlists.
  </p>
  <p>
    I like to play progressive rock/metal and hard rock on the guitar. Piano is occasional,
